stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> new
    new --> costing: estimator starts costing
    new --> routing_review: new routing
    routing_review --> ready_for_quote: Plant Head clears
    costing --> ready_for_quote
    costing --> routing_review
    ready_for_quote --> costing
    costing --> pending_approval: quote above 25 lakh
    costing --> approved: quote at or below 25 lakh
    pending_approval --> approved: Sales Head or Deputy approves
    pending_approval --> sent_back: send back with reason
    sent_back --> costing: re-cost, new version
    approved --> sent: estimator sends
    sent --> [*]
    new --> cancelled
    costing --> cancelled
    cancelled --> [*]
